From b53d8f021745ddf5eef14530710078edf20ce914 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Fran=C3=A7ois=20Cartegnie?= <fcvlcdev@free.fr>
Date: Tue, 21 Feb 2023 14:14:48 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] codec: videotoolbox: add VP9 hardware decoding
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

This works on recent Intel Macs, Apple Silicon Macs and
on some iOS devices running iOS 26.2 or newer.

Co-authored-by: Marvin Scholz <epirat07@gmail.com>
Co-authored-by: Felix Paul Kühne <fkuehne@videolan.org>

